  ;           (<NOT
  ;             <BTST ,BRICK-FLAG ,BF-PIT>> <MOVE ,NEW-BRICK ,BRICK-WALL>)>)> <RANDOM-ELEVATOR-MOTION> <COND
  ;         (<AND
  ;           <NOT <ZERO?
  ;             <GETP ,PRESSURE-VALVE ,P?VALUE>>>
  ;           <NOT
