  ; --- ZIL Source ---
  ; <ROUTINE BRONZE-PLUG-F ()
  ;   <COND
  ;       (<VERB? EXAMINE> <TELL
  ;         "This is a cylindrical bronze plug about two inches in diameter"> <COND
  ;         (<NOT
  ;           <FSET? ,PRSO ,TOUCHBIT>> <TELL
  ;           ". It is set in the center of the flat part of the dome.">)
