  ;           (<HERE? ,ELEVATOR-PIT> <TELL " and it's" ,LOOPED-AROUND-ROD>)
  ;           (<HERE? ,CS-BASEMENT> <TELL ,IT-DANGLES>)>)> <TELL "."> <COND (<HERE? ,ELEVATOR-PIT> <TELL-IF-LOCKED>)> <CRLF>)
