  ;             (<NOT <HELD? ,CHAIN>> <MOVE ,CHAIN ,HERE> <THIS-IS-IT ,CHAIN>)> <SETG CHAIN-HOOKED? <>> <RTRUE>)
  ;           (ELSE <TELL ,ITS-NOT-TIED>)>)
